# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FRONTEND (exposed to the browser, injected at build time by Vite).
# The anon key is a public, RLS-gated key — safe to ship to the client.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=replace-with-your-anon-key

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SERVER-SIDE ONLY — used by Edge Functions and local seed/admin scripts.
# The service-role key BYPASSES Row Level Security. NEVER expose it to the
# browser and NEVER prefix it with VITE_. Never commit the real value.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=replace-with-your-service-role-key

# For local development these are auto-populated by `npm run env:local`
# (which reads `supabase status`). For Vercel/cloud, set them in the dashboard.
